---
// Hero section styled in clean Rebus editorial aesthetic: bold typography, no emojis, no pills or badge chips
---

<section class="relative pt-16 pb-16 md:pt-24 md:pb-24 rebus-grid-bg border-b border-[#e5e0d4] overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Main Headline with Editorial Serif Accent -->
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#141413] text-balance leading-[1.1] mb-6">
      Turn text into speech.<br class="hidden sm:inline" />
      <span class="font-editorial-serif font-normal italic">Or create your own voice.</span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Subtitle: Dead-simple and crisp -->
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#5c5b56] max-w-xl mx-auto text-pretty leading-relaxed">
      Type any sentence to hear it spoken aloud. Or record 5 seconds to duplicate any voice. Completely free, instant, and private.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>
